cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
title: "YAIB AKI reproduction on the eICU and MIMIC-III demo cohorts: code, notebook and per-fold results"
abstract: >-
  Code, Google Colab notebook and per-fold results of an independent
  reproduction of the acute kidney injury (AKI) task of Yet Another ICU
  Benchmark (YAIB) on its public eICU and MIMIC-III demo cohorts, with an
  adaptation of the task to moderate-to-severe AKI (KDIGO stage 2 or higher).
type: software
